libkscreen (4:5.25.4-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Team upload.
  * Remove inactive Uploaders.
  * rules: switch from "egrep" to "grep -E", as the former has been deprecated
    for many years.
  * Modernize building:
    - add the dh-sequence-kf5 build dependency to use the kf5 addon
      automatically
    - drop all the manually specified addons and buildsystem for dh
  * copyright: remove extra empty line at the beginning of the file.
  * Restrict the qtwayland5-dev-tools build dependency as linux-any, as done
    for the other Wayland-related build dependencies.

